WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.020
This town is a sanctuary.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.220
Every man worth a name...

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.980
knows the value of being unreachable.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.240
It'd be a pity.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.420
not to recognize what's at stake.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.360
What's the move, AI?

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.200
You ever think, Bullock, of not going straight at a thing?

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.060
No.

